Hello PATRIO GABRIEL :

This pertains to your application to the 2024 DOST-SEI Undergraduate Schola=
rships.

[cid:image001.png@01DA6FAF.BFE49700]Your Test Permit is now available for d=
ownload via the E-Application System found at https://ugrad.science-scholar=
ships.ph/ .

[A screenshot of a computer application  Description automatically generate=
d]

Just sign-in your account in the system to download your test permit.

Here are your log-in credentials for reference:
Application ID:   vxgoHxbc
Registered Email Address: patriogabrielpatdu@gmail.com
Birthday:              4/29/2006

If you encounter any errors, kindly refresh your browser and try to redownl=
oad the permit.

Once downloaded, read it carefully and bring it on your examination day.

Please note that this assignment is already final and can no longer be chan=
ged as the test materials meant for you is already allocated in your assign=
ed test center.

[cid:image003.png@01DA6FAF.BFE49700]If there are documents that you need to=
 resubmit, kindly upload these by April 12, 2024. The application forms can=
 be found at https://ugrad.science-scholarships.ph/ .

[A screenshot of a chat  Description automatically generated]



For the School ID requirement, if you still do not have it, you may present=
 any ID as long as it has your picture. If you really do not have any ID, y=
ou may present your Birth Certificate.


Thank you and good luck!

This is a system generated message. There is no need to reply.

